== Effect ==
* Creates a {{dlc|nr+}} tiny / {{dlc|r+}} small pool of [[Creep#Yellow Creep|yellow creep]], damaging enemies that cross it.
** {{dlc|r+}} The pool lasts for the entire room, only disappearing when it is exited.
** The puddle deals 8 damage per tick or 24 damage per second.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can be spawned by {{e|Bumbino}} if he picks up 12 cents.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns yellow wisps in the middle ring. The wisps fire faster and have decreased range. The wisps themselves occasionally leave small puddles of yellow [[creep]] that last for 3 seconds and deal 7 damage per tick to enemies that walk over them (56 damage per second).}}
* {{T|Lost Cork}}: Doubles puddle size.

